<title>MALAYSIA: Malaysia EON 6-month net up 37.1 pct.</title>
<headline>Malaysia EON 6-month net up 37.1 pct.</headline>
<dateline>KUALA LUMPUR 1996-09-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Period to June 30</p>
<p>		   (in million ringgit unless stated)</p>
<p>    Net profit		 191.80   vs	 139.89</p>
<p>    Shr	 (cents)	 85.0    vs	  63.0</p>
<p>    Dividend  (percent)     15.0    vs	  10.0</p>
<p>    Turnover		 3,347.09   vs     2,482.63</p>
<p>    Pre-tax profit	   309.26   vs	 227.40</p>
<p>    Minorities	  less   8.92   vs  less   7.25</p>
<p>Note - Full name of company is Edaran Otomobil Nasional Bhd. It distributes Malaysia's national car Proton.</p>
<p>-- Kuala Lumpur newsroom (603 230 8911)</p>
